      "message": "While I don\u0027t want to discount the time difference, I have several concerns with moving this here. What is the primary benefit of having netd available earlier?\n\nSome of my concerns with this:\n\n1. Use of aconfig flags will break since this is prior to aconfig setup.\n2. Potential issues with selinux since this is prior to the recursive restorecon\n3. Other dependencies issues?",
